OL,5,G1330 Music Map
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch maps a musical
OL,7,     Fpath to the Wild Swans Suite by
OL,8,     Fthe Australian composer Elena
OL,9,     FKats-Chernin, which was famously
OL,10,     Fused in a TV advert.
OL,11,G1500 The Colours in Sound, with
OL,12,G     Caroline Shaw
OL,13,     FCaroline Shaw explores how
OL,14,     Fcomposers use their paint brushes
OL,15,     Fto draw light to hidden qualities
OL,16,     Fwithin tones. With music from
OL,17,     FMonteverdi to Messiaen, Debussy to
OL,18,     FDuke Ellington.
OL,19,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,20,     FAlyn Shipton with a selection of
OL,21,     Fclassics and new releases as
OL,22,     Frequested by you.
