OL,5,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,6,     FHannah French presents a concert
OL,7,     Fgiven by the Bellot Ensemble at
OL,8,     Fthe Beverley and East Riding Early
OL,9,     FMusic Festival.
OL,10,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,11,     FFrom Chichester Cathedral during
OL,12,     Fthe Southern Cathedrals Festival,
OL,13,     Fwith music by Ashfield, Rubbra and
OL,14,     FHowells.
OL,15,G1900 New Generation Artists
OL,16,     FViennese pianist Lukas Sternath
OL,17,     Fplays a movement from one of
OL,18,     FSchubert's late piano sonatas and
OL,19,     FElizaveta Ivanova explores Ervin
OL,20,     FSchulhoff's captivating Flute
OL,21,     FSonata of 1927.
